          "snippet": {
            "line": 769,
            "text": "theorem divergenceCoefficient_eq_zero_iff (h : ℝ) (f : SlowProfiles)\n    (n : ℕ) (w : InnerPoint) :\n    divergenceCoefficient h f n w = 0 ↔\n      partialX (f.flux n) w =\n        -Z h (axialExponent h + slowOrder h n) (f.axial n) w"
